    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but that \"adapting\" argument feels like a huge stretch and honestly pretty weak legally. if the Supreme Court literally said we have to use history and tradition, then trying to pivot back to \"social conditions\" is basically ignoring the law the Court just set. wouldn't you say that most legal scholars now agree that the historical test effectively shuts the door on most common-sense gun restrictions?",
